00:30:40,260 --> 00:30:43,731
No one as strong as you has
come around in quite some time.

515
00:30:45,080 --> 00:30:46,900
So as a swordsman's courtesy,

516
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:50,553
I'll use the world's strongest
black sword to finish you.

517
00:30:50,800 --> 00:30:51,630
Thank you.

518
00:30:51,820 --> 00:30:53,040
I appreciate it.

519
00:30:54,320 --> 00:30:55,150
Look!

520
00:30:55,233 --> 00:30:56,063
He took it out!

521
00:30:56,146 --> 00:30:57,657
That's the sword that sliced up the ship!

522
00:30:57,740 --> 00:30:59,920
So this is it.

523
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:03,360
Will it be the world's strongest or death?

524
00:31:08,340 --> 00:31:09,840
Enough, big bro!

525
00:31:10,060 --> 00:31:10,890
Stop it, please!

526
00:31:10,973 --> 00:31:12,260
Three-sword style secret technique!

527
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:16,240
Fall!

528
00:31:16,700 --> 00:31:17,800
3,000 worlds!

529
00:31:26,140 --> 00:31:27,120
I've lost.

530
00:31:28,780 --> 00:31:31,600
Never in my life did I imagine I'd lose.

531
00:31:33,800 --> 00:31:36,800
So this is the power of
the greatest in the world.

532
00:31:40,460 --> 00:31:41,480
But why?

533
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:45,471
Scars on the back are a swordsman's shame.

534
00:31:46,160 --> 00:31:46,990
Fine.

535
00:31:57,860 --> 00:32:01,080
You shouldn't rush
these things, young man.

536
00:32:02,500 --> 00:32:03,330
Zoro!

537
00:32:04,940 --> 00:32:06,240
Be probable!

538
00:32:07,800 --> 00:32:08,630
No!

539
00:32:09,800 --> 00:32:10,630
Why?

540
00:32:12,580 --> 00:32:16,437
I devoted my entire life to becoming
the world's greatest swordsman.

541
00:32:16,520 --> 00:32:20,344
It was my choice, so I'm the only
one who gets to call me stupid.

542
00:32:22,020 --> 00:32:23,100
He's insane.

543
00:32:23,520 --> 00:32:25,814
His opponent was way out of his league.

544
00:32:25,980 --> 00:32:28,497
How this fight would end
was clear from the start.

545
00:32:28,580 --> 00:32:29,580
Why choose death?

546
00:32:30,020 --> 00:32:31,180
Don't be stupid!

547
00:32:31,560 --> 00:32:33,560
Give up your ambition and live!

548
00:32:36,560 --> 00:32:39,940
So this is the power of the
Grand Line. It's terrifying.

549
00:32:40,980 --> 00:32:44,560
The pirate hunter Zoro was as
helpless as a newborn baby.

550
00:32:44,980 --> 00:32:45,920
Damn you!

551
00:32:48,860 --> 00:32:49,780
Big bro!

552
00:32:55,660 --> 00:32:57,540
He must be some kind of freak!

553
00:32:59,260 --> 00:33:03,025
So that loudmouthed little twerp
has the power of a Devil Fruit.

554
00:33:06,760 --> 00:33:09,140
Are you that young warrior's comrade?

555
00:33:09,520 --> 00:33:12,049
I'm impressed with you
for not interfering.

556
00:33:16,520 --> 00:33:18,520
There's nothing to be upset about.

557
00:33:18,660 --> 00:33:20,080
Your friend will live.

558
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:24,360
Big bro, say something, please! Zoro!

559
00:33:26,800 --> 00:33:27,630
Zoro!

560
00:33:28,080 --> 00:33:31,198
Come on, let's hurry up and
get him out of the water.

561
00:33:31,460 --> 00:33:33,260
I've got some medicine. Here!

562
00:33:33,620 --> 00:33:35,973
It's still far too early for you to die.

563
00:33:36,420 --> 00:33:39,060
My name is Hawkeye Mihawk.

564
00:33:39,520 --> 00:33:42,177
You're strong, but there
is much for you to learn.

565
00:33:42,260 --> 00:33:44,640
No matter how many years it takes,

566
00:33:44,860 --> 00:33:48,537
I will hold this title as the greatest
in the world and wait for you.

567
00:33:48,620 --> 00:33:51,340
Until that day, you must hone your skills.

568
00:33:51,780 --> 00:33:55,060
Then, seek me out, Roronoa Zoro!

569
00:33:56,560 --> 00:33:58,700
Please say something! Anything!

570
00:34:00,280 --> 00:34:04,220
Not just anyone can earn the
regard of Hawkeye Mihawk.

571
00:34:05,260 --> 00:34:06,090
You.

572
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:07,480
What is your goal?

573
00:34:08,060 --> 00:34:09,180
To be the king.

574
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:12,861
Your ambitions are even
loftier than your friends.

575
00:34:13,080 --> 00:34:14,256
That's quite a task.

576
00:34:14,480 --> 00:34:17,127
Yeah, well, you just
let me worry about that.

577
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:19,060
He's alive!

578
00:34:19,740 --> 00:34:22,400
He was just unconscious. Big Ro!

579
00:34:22,760 --> 00:34:24,878
If you're alive, then say something!

580
00:34:25,280 --> 00:34:26,110
Zoro!

581
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:27,760
Big Ro!

582
00:34:29,780 --> 00:34:30,610
Luffy!

583
00:34:31,380 --> 00:34:32,560
Can you hear me?

584
00:34:33,140 --> 00:34:33,970
Yeah!

585
00:34:35,300 --> 00:34:37,197
I'm sorry for disappointing you.

586
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:41,317
I know that you need nothing less than
the greatest swordsman in the world.

587
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:42,540
I've let you down.

588
00:34:43,460 --> 00:34:44,700
Please forgive me.

589
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:48,400
Okay, okay!

590
00:34:48,580 --> 00:34:49,877
You can stop saying things now!

591
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:50,790
Bro!

592
00:34:51,020 --> 00:34:57,120
I solemnly swear, from this moment
forward, that I will never lose again!

593
00:34:59,380 --> 00:35:03,340
Until the day comes when I
defeat him and take his title!

594
00:35:04,680 --> 00:35:07,340
I will never, never be defeated!

595
00:35:08,560 --> 00:35:12,320
Is that okay, King of the Pirates?

596
00:35:16,980 --> 00:35:17,810
Yep.

597
00:35:18,300 --> 00:35:19,420
You're a good team.

598
00:35:19,840 --> 00:35:22,260
I hope to see you again someday.

599
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:25,200
Hey, Hawkeye!

600
00:35:26,340 --> 00:35:29,897
I was under the impression that
you had come here to take my life.

601
00:35:29,980 --> 00:35:33,451
Weren't you here to kill Don
Krieg, ruler of the East Blue?

602
00:35:33,740 --> 00:35:35,622
The thought had crossed my mind,

603
00:35:35,880 --> 00:35:39,857
but I've had enough fun for today,
so I'm going home to get some rest.

604
00:35:39,940 --> 00:35:41,657
I don't care if you've had enough.

605
00:35:41,740 --> 00:35:43,497
I haven't even gotten started.

606
00:35:43,580 --> 00:35:44,657
Um, but, sir...

607
00:35:44,740 --> 00:35:47,577
Maybe it's not a good idea
to try to keep him here.

608
00:35:47,660 --> 00:35:49,500
Now it's time to die!

609
00:35:50,720 --> 00:35:53,040
He just won't learn, will he?

610
00:36:01,500 --> 00:36:02,780
Goddamn, he escaped!

611
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:13,150
Who's up?

612
00:36:13,940 --> 00:36:14,770
Luffy!

613
00:36:14,853 --> 00:36:15,800
Go on ahead!

614
00:36:16,100 --> 00:36:18,520
I'll leave Nami to you! Roger that!

615
00:36:18,680 --> 00:36:20,077
Don't you worry about a thing!

616
00:36:20,160 --> 00:36:21,917
Zoro and I are gonna get her right back!

617
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:24,417
And make sure you get that
cook to join our crew!

618
00:36:24,500 --> 00:36:29,180
And then, on the Going Merry, the five
of us will set sail to the Grand Line!

619
00:36:30,080 --> 00:36:30,910
Yeah!

620
00:36:31,020 --> 00:36:31,877
Let's do it!

621
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:33,100
All right, Ben.

622
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:37,317
We ran into a little distraction from
our plan, but the real fight starts now.

623
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:39,820
We're gonna take that ship! Yes, sir!

624
00:36:40,260 --> 00:36:41,180
Hey, Pops!

625
00:36:41,300 --> 00:36:44,677
Can I stop doing these chores if
I get those pirates out of here?

626
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:45,701
Search yourself.

627
00:37:01,960 --> 00:37:05,357
I had to find my way to that place.

628
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:08,357
Before someone could beat me!

629
00:37:08,440 --> 00:37:12,437
The promised land was in my grasp.

630
00:37:12,520 --> 00:37:15,140
And I wouldn't let go.

631
00:37:16,240 --> 00:37:18,877
La la la la.

632
00:37:18,960 --> 00:37:20,217
My only dream.

633
00:37:20,300 --> 00:37:22,377
La la la la la.

634
00:37:22,460 --> 00:37:28,080
I won't stop chasing
it until it comes true.

635
00:37:29,980 --> 00:37:33,657
But if the world ever changes,

636
00:37:33,740 --> 00:37:36,937
I call out your name?

637
00:37:37,020 --> 00:37:43,440
We return to the time when
everything's the same.

638
00:37:44,140 --> 00:37:50,460
As long as I'm with you,
my memories won't fade.

639
00:37:51,220 --> 00:37:55,800
Waiting for that one true dream. You
